    <code code="10187-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Review of systems Narrative - Reported"/>
    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Positive</td><td>Exertional chest tightness, less often; no rest pain, palpitations, or ankle swelling</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Positive</td><td>Breathless with the chest tightness only; morning cough less</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Mild nausea after the morning varenicline dose</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Sleeping well; no low mood, agitation, or unusual dreams troubling him</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

